 to:","section_2_heading_size":32,"section_2_heading_color":"#ffffff","section_2_heading_margin":20,"section_2_bg":"#1b2e5c","section_2_padding":50,"section_2_alignment":"center","section_2_cards_margin":30,"section_2_card_bg":"#ffffff","section_2_card_border_width":2,"section_2_card_border_color":"#eef3e6","section_2_card_radius":12,"section_2_card_padding":30,"section_2_card_gap":20,"section_2_card_inner_gap":20,"section_2_number_size":40,"section_2_number_color":"#5ec2e7","section_2_number_width":60,"section_2_card_title_size":20,"section_2_card_title_color":"#1b2e5c","section_2_title_margin":10,"section_2_card_text_size":14,"section_2_card_text_color":"#1b2e5c","section_2_card_1_title":"Read and re-read labels before every snack","section_2_card_1_text":"Age-appropriate formulation is built in. The age on the box is the answer.","section_2_card_2_title":"Wonder if the texture is safe","section_2_card_2_text":"Melt-on-contact behaviour means safe snacking before chewing is fully developed, every single time.","section_2_card_3_title":"Worry about digestive upset","section_2_card_3_text":"Inulin prebiotic + probiotic integration works with the gut, not against it.","section_2_card_4_title":"Compromise convenience for quality","section_2_card_4_text":"Grab-and-go ready without the doubt. Every snack, every scenario.","section_3_heading":"No label anxiety. No \"is this okay for their age?\" moment. Just a snack that fits - right now, at exactly this age.","section_3_heading_size":30,"section_3_heading_color":"#ffffff","section_3_heading_margin":15,"section_3_text":"Halal Certified · No Refined Sugar or Salt · No Preservatives · No Artificial Flavour · Pre + Probiotics · Brand of Singapore","section_3_text_size":16,"section_3_text_color":"#ffffff","section_3_text_margin":25,"section_3_bg":"#1b2e5c","section_3_padding":50,"section_3_alignment":"center","section_3_button_text":"SHOP CONFIDENTLY - FIND YOUR CHILD'S BUNDLE","section_3_button_link":"https:\/\/hltone.myshopify.com\/collections\/bundles-and-gift-sets","section_3_button_text_size":16,"section_3_button_bg":"#eef6fc","section_3_button_text_color":"#1b2e5c","section_3_button_hover_bg":"#1b2e5c","section_3_button_hover_text":"#ffffff","section_3_button_padding_v":12,"section_3_button_padding_h":30,"section_3_button_radius":40,"section_3_button_border_width":0,"section_3_button_border_color":"#3f4e1f"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_4460a24_bit7fh"],"name":"Handover","settings":{}},"17804175960a191dde":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_e66986b_NAfb7d":{"type":"ai_gen_block_e66986b","settings":{"desktop_width_percent":100,"max_content_width":800,"section_padding":40,"background_color":"#fffbf1","border_radius":12,"heading":"Your child deserves snacks <em>built for them<\/em>. Not just free from the worst.","heading_size":46,"heading_color":"#1b2e5c","description":"<p>Every Singapore parent who's stood in the baby food aisle knows the exhaustion of choosing by elimination - picking the one with the least to object to, not the one most designed for their child.<strong> <\/strong> <strong>StageWise™ ends that search.<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":16,"text_color":"#1b2e5c","text_alignment":"center","button_text":"SHOP CONFIDENTLY - FIND YOUR CHILD BUNDLE","button_link":"#buy-section","button_text_size":16,"button_bg_color":"#192e59","button_hover_bg_color":"#8abadb","button_text_color":"#f2efdd","button_border_radius":40,"item_spacing":12,"item_border_thickness":0,"item_border_color":"#1b2e5c","item_border_radius":12,"question_text_size":16,"question_bg_color":"#fffbf1","question_hover_bg_color":"#f9f7f1","question_text_color":"#1b2e5c","answer_text_size":14,"answer_bg_color":"#f9f7f1","answer_text_color":"#1b2e5c","question_1":"Q: My child is 10 months - which age range do I choose?","answer_1":"<p>A: Start with the 6m+ range. For 10 months, the serving guidance recommends 3–5 melts per serving, up to 3 times per week. The 12m+ range becomes appropriate as your child develops stronger chewing ability around 12 months. The Gentle Tummy Bundle and Snack Explorer Box are both ideal first introductions for this age.<\/p>","question_2":"Q: What makes StageWise™ different from other freeze-dried baby snacks?","answer_2":"<p>A: Most freeze-dried baby snacks use the preservation method but don't engineer around it. StageWise™ is built on the melt-on-contact behaviour, used deliberately as a safety and acceptance feature. It's the only system with age-calibrated formulation (6m+, 12m+, 18m+), inulin prebiotic + probiotic strains integrated into the base formulation, and up to 97% nutrient retention.<\/p>","question_3":"Q: My baby already has a good snack routine. Why should I switch?","answer_3":"<p>A: You don't have to switch everything. If your current snacks are working - no rejection, no tummy issues, no label anxiety - you may not need to change anything. But if any of those are present, the formulation gap is almost always why. Try the Snack Explorer Box as a low-commitment way to discover the difference.<\/p>","question_4":"Q: Are Yummybara snacks Halal certified?","answer_4":"<p>A: Yes. All Yummybara products are Halal certified. This is a non-negotiable product standard, displayed clearly on every product box - not an optional add-on.<\/p>","question_5":"Q: What if my child rejects the snack?","answer_5":"<p>A:  Yummybara's texture is engineered for acceptance - gentler textures at the start remove the texture barrier that causes most early rejections. If your child doesn't take to a particular flavour, the Snack Explorer Box gives you five distinct fruit varieties to discover what your child gravitates to.<\/p>","question_6":"Q: How quickly will we see a difference in tummy comfort?","answer_6":"<p>A: Many parents notice a difference within 1–2 weeks of consistent snacking - particularly a reduction in digestive upsets and more predictable gut responses. Inulin prebiotic and probiotic support is cumulative; the daily snacking habit is the delivery mechanism.<\/p>","question_7":"Q: Where can I buy Yummybara in Singapore?","answer_7":"<p>A: Available online with island-wide delivery. We're also stocked at select retailers - check our stockist page for locations near you. Online orders include full age-range guidance and direct parent support.<\/p>"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_e66986b_NAfb7d"],"name":"FAQ Section","settings":{}}},"order":["main","related-products","blocks_behMMm","blocks_bewRHF","17811860860e0b421c","blocks_8WYXKW","blocks_tzmJmU","blocks_CTgrHx","1781190906bf355ea9","178033254947d32fff","17804160582291aded","17804988179b48353d","image_banner_FnEP7A","17804999762c407edc","17804175960a191dde"]}